  "goodToKnow": "Verlauten is a journalistic word meaning to be announced or reported: Wie aus Polizeikreisen verlautete... (according to police sources), wie verlautet (reportedly). Etwas verlauten lassen means to announce or let it be known, often negated: Er ließ nichts verlauten (he didn't comment). Synonyms: bekannt werden, mitteilen. Die Verlautbarung is an official announcement."
